{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meat Grinder is a mysterious open-world simulation-adventure game where you must find creative solutions to keep your shop running in a town full of strange secrets.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/extras/Atmosphere_MeatGrinder.gif?t=1742846301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you grow your hot dog shop in the foggy streets of Grimshore, you'll encounter the town\u2019s eerie, unsettling mysteries and step into its darkest corners. While discovering new ingredients and expanding your business, hidden stories and secret areas await you. But behind every corner lie questions you may not want to know the answers to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/extras/Gameplay1_MeatGrinder.gif?t=1742846301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the day, you run your shop and serve food, while at night, you resort to unusual methods to replenish your meat supply. You will explore side quests in the open world, become involved in different stories, and confront disturbing truths about your character\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/extras/Digging_MeatGrinder.gif?t=1742846301\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark and atmospheric open-world environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person perspective with simulation mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daytime shop management, cooking, and customer interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nighttime excursions to acquire meat through unconventional means.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side stories that reveal the town\u2019s deep secrets and a main story that delves into your character\u2019s past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden areas and side quests waiting to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro PS1-style graphics and nostalgic visual aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/extras/Freezer_MeatGrinder.gif?t=1742846301\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502230?t=1742846301","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/66bd2cfaddfdfbdbd003bfb7027c457031f0dd2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742846301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/6d59a4b8bb5f6f6aa76cc8381a480bd8d752625b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742846301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/6d59a4b8bb5f6f6aa76cc8381a480bd8d752625b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742846301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features intense violence scenes visualized in a PSX style. Additionally, you may encounter themes of alcohol, drugs, BDSM elements, and self-harm, depicted solely through environmental details and visual imagery."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meat Grinder is a mysterious open-world simulation-adventure game where you must find creative solutions to keep your shop running in a town full of 